5,1,1,talk,Mio,,We need a place everyone can afford and enjoy. Let's make sure we check the transport costs and how the fees are handled.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, dear. I also hope we can find a place that encourages the younger and older members to actually talk to one another.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We should be mindful of the administrative burden. I don't want the organizers spending all their time on paperwork instead of training.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,And the sleep! Last year was exhausting. I want to know exactly what the rooms are like before we decide.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We must be precise with the budget. I'll look into the actual costs to ensure we don't have another deficit.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if you're worried about work, maybe we should look at the booking processes for different types of venues?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,That's a good point. Perhaps we should also see why some people didn't attend the last few camps.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,Yes. I'll check the public booking systems and the cooking duties from last year to see what we can avoid.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'll check the accounts from other clubs who went inland. I bet they have the same sleep problems we had.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will examine the transport receipts and the rate sheets for public beds to get a baseline for the costs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll take the membership list against train times. It's not fair if some people pay more just to get there.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look into what the seniors say about the year-groups mixing. We need a social strategy.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'll also check the quoting terms for whole-building lets. I suspect those might be simpler or more complex than they seem.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'll also look at the attendance sheets for away camps. Maybe the location is why people skip it.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll add the vacation timetable for our own hall to my list. Staying on campus might be the safest financial bet.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
