35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Transport is a huge part of the cost. Also, many members can't even reach campus by 9 AM without staying overnight.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,It seems the only time the year-groups actually bond is during the evenings when they all sleep in the same place.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Public bookings are a nightmare of paperwork, and cooking for ourselves on campus is a massive time sink for the staff.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Public beds are cheap, but other clubs reported sleeping eight to a room with strict curfews. That sounds miserable.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Our own hall is crowded with other clubs, and whole-building lets have non-refundable deposits that punish the group if someone drops out.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, if the hall is crowded, does that mean we can't have a continuous block of training?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"And @Rin, if the public beds are too cramped, people might just stop attending altogether.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Exactly. If we go with a public center, the lottery and the application process are far too risky and tedious.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,I can't support anywhere that ruins our sleep. We need a place where we can actually recover between sessions.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, yes, the timetable is split. It would be inefficient. But a private lodge's fixed headcount is a financial risk.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"If we stay local, transport is cheap, but the overnight costs for commuters still exist. It's a tricky balance.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"We must prioritize the social bond. If we don't stay together in one place, the club will continue to fragment.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I'm leaning away from anything that requires a nine-page application or hours of cooking duty.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I want a place with proper rooms. The inland public centers sound like a recipe for exhaustion.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I cannot support a plan where the remaining members have to cover the cost of late cancellations.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
