60,3,1,talk,Mio,,Option A is cheap for transport but unfair for those who have to pay for separate beds.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Option A fails the social test. We need the shared environment of Option B or C to bridge the year-groups.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Option B is a bureaucratic disaster. Option C is the most straightforward for the organizers, despite the cost.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,Option B's sleeping conditions are a dealbreaker. Option C sounds much more comfortable for actual rest.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option C's non-refundable deposit is a huge risk. Option A is the only one with a predictable budget.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Misaki, but Option A's separate accommodation costs are unpredictable too. Option C is a flat fee for the building.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, please consider the members. If we stay on campus, the younger ones will just stick together and ignore the seniors.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, the labor cost of Option A's cooking and Option B's paperwork is too high. Option C is the most efficient.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for Option C. I can't do another camp where I'm exhausted by day three.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I still worry about the deficit. If people drop out of Option C, the club account takes the hit.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I think Option C is the fairest if we set the fee correctly from the start.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The Coastal Lodge allows us to be a community again.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,It's the only choice that doesn't enslave the organizers to paperwork or kitchens.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,Definitely Option C.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"If everyone else is this certain, I'll concede, but we must be extremely strict with the initial payment.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
